<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Questar cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Questar cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppemheimer &amp; Co analyst William Hyler confirmed he cut his rating on Questar Corp to market perform from buy, saying the stock had hit his price target.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/8 at 36-7/8.</p>
</text>
